+
+Show the Config
+---------------
+
+The :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command will print the loaded
+application's configuration as JSON. Any key containing "SECRET",
+"PASSWORD", "TOKEN", or "KEY" is masked.
+
+::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "ENV": "production",
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      ...
+    }
+
+
 Open a Shell
